# Conformance probe pack for spec 0.94: an outer pack: the `inner` line in a kind that is not chosen. Public.
format     conformance-held-outother
version    0.94.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
layout     sequential
bit_order  msb
kind    first
when    8  1
field   probe.w  8  uint
kind    second
when    8  2
requires probe.c1
inner   conformance-held-in
